{required_start}Files Loona always loads ({required_count}){required_summary_end}

Your dashboards or shared styling need these files, or Loona cannot safely judge whether they are used.

{required}

Card types with no matching file ({unresolved_count}): {unresolved}

Saved files that no longer exist ({stale_count}): {stale}

Selecting Skip unused card files will load only the card files your dashboards need. Loona will still load anything it cannot safely judge. If it finds a template it cannot read on any dashboard, every card file is loaded.

Extra card files to load lets you keep specific card files that Loona would otherwise skip, such as files your pop-ups or other features need even though no dashboard uses them. Tick the extra files you need and untick saved files you no longer want. Always reload the dashboard after you make a change. If Skip unused card files is not working, check the diagnostics.
